      "Physical Education and Sports Co-scholastic Activities",
      "1. Introduction",
      "Recognizing the crucial role of physical education and sports in the holistic development of students, this policy outlines the framework for integrating physical education and sports as an essential co-scholastic area within the school curriculum. Physical activity contributes significantly to students' physical fitness, mental well-being, social skills, and overall health and development.",
