      "To develop students' motor skills, physical fitness, and knowledge of various sports and games.",
      "To foster social skills such as teamwork, cooperation, leadership, fair play, and respect for others through participation in sports.",
      "To provide opportunities for students to explore their interests and talents in diverse physical activities and sports.",
      "To instill values of perseverance, discipline, ethical behavior, and sportsmanship.",
      "To integrate physical education and sports with other academic subjects for a well-rounded and fulfilling educational experience.",
      "4. Curriculum and activities",
