      "We promote inquiry-based learning by encouraging students to pose open-ended questions, conduct in-depth research, and take responsibility for their own learning journey. Students are empowered to explore topics with curiosity and rigor, fostering a sense of ownership over their academic pursuits. Our methodology shifts from \"what to learn\" to \"how to learn,\" integrating hands-on, experiential activities such as:",
      "Project-Based Learning: Teachers facilitate collaborative, interdisciplinary projects that require students to apply knowledge from multiple subjects to solve complex problems.",
