      "Club Executive Coordinators: Two designated Health & Wellness Ambassadors (Mrs. Bhuvnesh Pauchari ( School  WellnessCounselorand) Ms. Rubi Kumari ( PGT ). Formally certified under the Ayushman Bharat pedagogical module to drive operations.",
      "Clinical Support Anchor: Resident Medical Officer / Institution Nurse. Manages the campus infirmary, anchors triage logs during physical activities, and leads health metric auditing.",
