      "5. Leave Policy",
      "The school provides various types of leave to support the well-being and personal needs of its employees. All leave applications must be submitted and approved in advance, except in cases of emergency.",
      "Casual Leave (CL): A fixed number of days per academic year for unforeseen personal matters.",
      "Sick Leave (SL): A fixed number of days per academic year for illness, supported by a medical certificate for extended periods.",
      "Maternity/Paternity Leave: Leave will be granted as per government regulations.",
      "Bereavement Leave: Leave will be granted for a specific number of days in the event of the death of a close family member.",
      "6. Sexual Harassment at the Workplace Policy",
      "G.D. Goenka Public School, Aligarh, is committed to providing a work environment free from sexual harassment. The school strictly adheres to the Sexual Harassment of Women at Workplace (Prevention, Prohibition and Redressal) Act, 2013 (POSH Act).",
